    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What are you talking about? A professional? Look around you. There's no one left. The walls are crumbling and the enemy is at the gate. I'm not talking about 'struggles', I'm talking about the end of everything. I'm talking about the fact that my life has become a joke and a disgrace. I just wanted someone to understand the weight of it, not give me a lecture.",
